  * Displacement at peak $u(F_{\max}) = 0.005775\,\text{mm}$ is within **$-1.45\%$** of the literature target ($0.005860\,\text{mm}$).
  * This confirms that the 15,396-element adaptive mesh accurately reproduces the benchmark fracture load.
- **Fixed-Mesh Reference (`1401091`)**:
